# Tests — `test/components`

## Role

- Assert rendering and critical elements (titles, buttons, empty states, badges) without a full browser run unless necessary.

## Strategy

1. Happy path: `render_inline(Component.new(...))` with minimal valid props; assert on stable text/selector.
2. One secondary variant per important axis (nil/empty collection/flag/auth stub) — not an exhaustive CSS-class matrix.
3. Stub heavy dependencies (helpers, `Current`, policy objects, APIs); no real I/O.
4. Previews are not regression tests unless explicitly requested.

## Performance

- Avoid full-stack Capybara by default; stay at component render level.
